{"product":{"id":9697331282226,"title":"Sugarman","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eA dual roast single origin that is easier to think of as a blend. Good for someone that likes to try what's new. Presently it is presenting moderate acidity and yellow fruit flavours with chocolate finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eOrigin: Brazil\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eFarm: Sucuri\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eProcess method: Natural\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eVarietal: Yellow Catuai\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eTasting notes: Rose, apricot, ripe fruit, floral, milk chocolate finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eBrew: Stovetop, espresso, French press\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eRecommended Recipe: \u003cu\u003eEspresso\u003c\/u\u003e: 1:1.85 grams-in-to-grams-out over 30 seconds. If it tastes sour, run the shot for longer. If washed out or bitter shorten then shot until you find a flavour profile you enjoy\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Hark Coffee","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-11-14T17:53:21+10:30","handle":"sugarman","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:38+09:30","published_at":"2024-11-14T17:53:26+10:30","template_suffix":"sugarman","published_scope":"global","tags":"blend, build-box, coffee, espresso, french press, medium dark, plunger, seasonal, single origin, stove top","variants":[{"id":49855399428402,"product_id":9697331282226,"title":"400g \/ Whole Beans","price":"41.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"400g","option2":"Whole Beans","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-03-20T23:12:23+10:30","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:38+09:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"AUD","compare_at_price_currency